content.text:
The evidence points to one fault. The reservation pod's container never became ready in the incident window, its restart count kept climbing from 3 to 6, and every call to it from frontend failed fast.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "reservation",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "metric",
          "sql": "SELECT metric, value, count(*) n FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'reservation-%' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.restarts','k8s.container.ready') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "Reservation pod container stayed not-ready (ready=0 in all 11 samples) while its restart count climbed from 3 to 6."
        },
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name LIKE 'reservation.Reservation/%' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2,3",
          "claim": "No reservation server spans appear in the abnormal period; frontend's CheckAvailability client spans all error in about 0.01 ms."
        },
        {
          "kind": "log",
          "sql": "SELECT service_name, level, substr(message,1,120) msg, count(*) n FROM abnormal_logs WHERE service_name='frontend' AND level='ERROR' GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 4 DESC",
          "claim": "Frontend logged 342 'Reservation check availability failed' errors during the incident; reservation itself logged nothing."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "reservation",
      "to": "frontend",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "trace",
          "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms, sum(CASE WHEN attr_http_response_status_code>=400 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) http_5xx FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND (span_name='HTTP /hotels' OR span_name LIKE 'reservation.Reservation/%') GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY 1,2",
          "claim": "All 718 frontend /hotels server spans error; reservation client calls fail, so user-facing /hotels requests fail."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
